WEBVTT

00:02.520 --> 00:07.190
<i>I'll pry open any locked doors in my way</i>

00:07.190 --> 00:11.520
<i>Charging at full speed, straight ahead</i>

00:09.480 --> 00:14.910
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold
in Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

00:11.520 --> 00:13.330
<i>That's how I live</i>

00:23.000 --> 00:29.750
<i>I keep turning them over in my mind</i>

00:29.750 --> 00:32.720
<i>All the things I want to do</i>

00:32.720 --> 00:39.970
<i>Even if I'm told that's not 
what's expected of me</i>

00:39.970 --> 00:43.310
<i>I don't plan on giving them up</i>

00:43.310 --> 00:51.870
<i>Ah, dreams are meant to be big</i>

00:51.870 --> 00:56.840
<i>I'll head where the shining coin points me</i>

00:56.840 --> 01:01.870
<i>And nothing can stop me</i>

01:01.870 --> 01:07.000
<i>I won't back down, I'll face forward</i>

01:07.000 --> 01:12.250
<i>So I can fulfill my dream</i>

01:12.550 --> 01:17.180
<i>I'll pry open any locked doors in my way</i>

01:17.180 --> 01:21.560
<i>Wind at my back, giving it my all</i>

01:21.560 --> 01:23.300
<i>That's how I live</i>

01:29.980 --> 01:32.980
Saving 80,000 Gold
in Another World

01:35.060 --> 01:37.980
H-Hey! What the hell is that?!

01:37.980 --> 01:39.320
That's...

01:39.320 --> 01:41.370
What's taking you so long?

01:41.370 --> 01:43.740
Useless inferior beings!

01:43.740 --> 01:44.820
The Great Ancient Dragon!

01:44.820 --> 01:46.870
A dragon?! Seriously?

01:46.870 --> 01:49.890
<i>We're dealing with a real big shot now!</i>

01:49.890 --> 01:51.060
An ancient dragon!

01:51.060 --> 01:53.400
Legend says that they possess intelligence 
far exceeding that of humans,

01:53.400 --> 01:56.130
and can unleash a magical breath attack!

01:56.720 --> 01:59.170
<i>They had one of those on their side?</i>

01:59.170 --> 02:02.810
<i>I think I know why the Empire decided 
to launch such a reckless invasion.</i>

02:03.230 --> 02:06.730
The ancient dragon must also 
have lent the Empire its wisdom,

02:06.730 --> 02:08.810
which is how they're conducting their 
troops in tandem with those monsters.

02:09.170 --> 02:12.400
But why would an ancient dragon 
meddle in human affairs?

02:12.400 --> 02:14.550
You know all too well 
that the fun can't begin

02:14.550 --> 02:17.210
unless you take the royal capital here!

02:17.960 --> 02:19.570
My deepest apologies!

02:20.100 --> 02:21.660
<i>Did he say fun?!</i>

02:21.660 --> 02:22.830
That's<i> his reason?!</i>

02:23.910 --> 02:26.330
So be it. Let me lend you some help.

02:34.340 --> 02:37.670
I am a wise and mighty ancient dragon,

02:37.670 --> 02:41.970
reigning over this world 
and guiding the foolish!

03:03.410 --> 03:07.660
<i>This is the projection mapping strategy 
I came up with to scare the Empire's army!</i>

03:07.660 --> 03:09.000
<i>I won't lose in size!</i>

03:09.610 --> 03:12.960
Great Dragon. I do hope I find you well.

03:12.960 --> 03:16.360
I'm in a foul mood, thanks to you lot!

03:16.360 --> 03:17.880
Why don't we talk things over?

03:17.880 --> 03:20.640
I'll blow you away with a single breath!

03:21.090 --> 03:24.370
Not in the mood to talk? Is that so?

03:24.370 --> 03:25.600
Then I'll get the first shot in!

03:29.410 --> 03:31.350
<i>Nine-millimeter ammo has no effect.</i>

03:32.170 --> 03:33.690
<i>Well, I'd expected as much.</i>

03:33.690 --> 03:35.980
Perish at once!

03:44.020 --> 03:45.200
It can't be!

03:45.200 --> 03:46.450
Miss Mitsuha!

03:46.450 --> 03:48.910
Hmph! How trivial.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.210
Ready all guns!

03:57.160 --> 03:58.840
Light infantry, fire!

04:01.170 --> 04:04.070
That's not enough to make me even flinch!

04:04.070 --> 04:06.430
<i>Well, looks like it's making a dent in him.</i>

04:06.430 --> 04:07.720
Machine guns, fire!

04:10.100 --> 04:12.950
Ow! Ow, ow, ow!

04:12.040 --> 04:15.900
<i>All right! We'll hit him all at once 
before he can strike back!</i>

04:15.900 --> 04:17.440
Heavy machine guns, fire!

04:20.290 --> 04:22.950
Curses! You've done it now!

04:22.950 --> 04:26.000
Dear God! Please help me!

04:35.210 --> 04:36.560
Cease fire!

04:40.980 --> 04:41.750
He's firing his breath!

04:41.750 --> 04:43.100
Everyone, get out of the way!

04:46.720 --> 04:48.010
RPGs, fire!

04:50.800 --> 04:55.520
<i>It looks like he can't attack either 
while he's got that wall of light up.</i>

04:55.520 --> 04:57.560
<i>But our ammo isn't infinite...</i>

04:59.060 --> 05:02.150
<i>We need to wait until he 
lets his defenses down.</i>

05:08.540 --> 05:11.740
Captain! Provoke him to 
get him to open his mouth!

05:11.740 --> 05:12.410
Eh?!

05:14.580 --> 05:18.010
Not even Miss Mitsuha's soldiers can 
take down an ancient dragon, then?

05:19.590 --> 05:22.590
Miss Mitsuha's disembarked the war wagon!

05:23.530 --> 05:25.720
Concentrate fire on his head!

05:25.720 --> 05:29.100
Copy that! Heavy machine guns, cease fire!

05:30.270 --> 05:31.720
All right, you dragon.

05:31.720 --> 05:34.110
Have a taste of the wrath of God!

05:37.740 --> 05:39.020
How irritating...

05:42.230 --> 05:43.690
Is that all?

05:43.690 --> 05:46.450
I'll blow you all to smithereens!

05:46.450 --> 05:47.580
Now!

05:52.280 --> 05:55.080
Virtual cross hair, brightness 20!

05:55.080 --> 05:56.330
Fire!

05:59.500 --> 06:01.150
I did it!

06:14.890 --> 06:16.440
Well, Great Dragon?

06:16.440 --> 06:18.280
How do you like the taste of my firebolt?

06:29.240 --> 06:32.620
I'm dying! They're gonna kill me!

06:33.080 --> 06:35.580
No... Please wait, Great Ancient Dragon!

06:35.580 --> 06:37.340
Great Ancient Dragon!

06:39.040 --> 06:41.190
This can't be!

06:41.190 --> 06:43.100
Ah, ah...

06:44.800 --> 06:46.880
How did you like the wrath of God?

06:47.560 --> 06:51.390
Soldiers of the Imperial army, 
we've still got ammo to spare!

06:57.760 --> 06:59.690
The monsters are running away!

07:03.400 --> 07:05.020
It seems that we've won...

07:05.020 --> 07:06.570
We can breathe a little easier for now.

07:06.980 --> 07:10.650
<i>Messenger of Lightning... 
no, our goddess of salvation...</i>

07:12.170 --> 07:17.640
<i>Garrisons to the north, east, and west have 
driven back the traitorous lords' forces!</i>

07:17.640 --> 07:18.500
Roger that!

07:19.390 --> 07:23.890
<i>I'm glad the people stationed at 
the other gates got to do something, as well!</i>

07:23.890 --> 07:25.690
What do we do, young lady?

07:25.690 --> 07:28.140
Should we go after 
the fleeing defeated enemy?

07:28.140 --> 07:31.720
No, let's leave that to this country's soldiers.

07:36.460 --> 07:39.390
Marquis Aiblinger, I leave the rest to you!

07:39.790 --> 07:43.260
Yes, we'll have provincial armies across 
the kingdom send troops in pursuit.

07:43.260 --> 07:45.730
I'm sure few will make it all 
the way back to the Empire.

07:45.730 --> 07:47.400
Punitive forces, onward!

07:52.600 --> 07:54.620
What are you going to do with that?

07:54.620 --> 07:57.240
It's a memento. Can we take it back with us?

07:57.600 --> 08:01.260
Well, I'm sure you won't get 
another chance to vanquish a dragon.

08:01.260 --> 08:02.580
I don't see a problem with that.

08:04.520 --> 08:06.440
We will now make our return!

08:06.440 --> 08:08.090
All vehicles, forward!

08:13.050 --> 08:13.760
Thank you!

08:13.760 --> 08:16.630
Thank you, emissary from the gods!

08:16.630 --> 08:19.720
Long live the Messenger of Lightning!

08:19.720 --> 08:21.320
Thank you!

08:39.760 --> 08:42.250
Miss Mitsuha, where are the others?

08:42.680 --> 08:44.830
They've returned to their country.

08:45.210 --> 08:48.540
I see... I wanted to give them my thanks.

08:48.540 --> 08:52.850
Miss Mitsuha, I offer you a million thanks.

08:52.850 --> 08:54.320
Your Majesty!

08:54.980 --> 08:56.400
Mitsuha!

08:56.400 --> 08:59.260
Elder Sister Mitsuha, 
I'm so glad you're unhurt!

08:59.260 --> 09:01.640
Thanks, Sabine!

09:04.980 --> 09:07.940
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

09:07.940 --> 09:10.940
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

09:11.820 --> 09:14.300
I'm not getting any customers...

09:14.300 --> 09:17.020
Well, the capital was in an uproar 
over the invasion until recently.

09:17.020 --> 09:18.300
Guess it's only natural.

09:21.430 --> 09:24.360
All the mail and shipments 
delayed during wartime

09:24.360 --> 09:26.720
are making their way around all at once now.

09:27.310 --> 09:29.090
I'm busy as can be!

09:29.090 --> 09:30.880
Thanks for all your hard work!

09:34.070 --> 09:36.750
This letter... It's from Colette!

09:39.760 --> 09:42.070
<i>Mitsuha, how are you doing?</i>

09:42.070 --> 09:45.150
<i>Dad said that with 
the neighboring empire invading,</i>

09:45.150 --> 09:50.770
<i>the royal capital's in trouble, 
so I'm really worried about you.</i>

09:50.770 --> 09:52.340
Colette...

09:52.340 --> 09:55.160
<i>Promise me you won't do anything dangerous!</i>

09:55.160 --> 09:57.810
Haha... A bit too late for that...

09:59.160 --> 10:00.040
Eh?

10:00.040 --> 10:01.370
Elder Sister Mitsuha.

10:01.770 --> 10:03.830
Ah... welcome!

10:04.650 --> 10:05.910
This is for you.

10:08.920 --> 10:10.080
<i>It's time!</i>

10:10.080 --> 10:12.880
<i>An invitation to the royal palace 
for an honor awards ceremony!</i>

10:13.430 --> 10:16.840
<i>It's not just me. There are 
a lot of deserving people.</i>

10:17.530 --> 10:19.800
<i>The provincial armies who slowed 
down the enemies early on,</i>

10:19.800 --> 10:21.270
<i>those who gathered intelligence,</i>

10:21.270 --> 10:23.010
<i>mercenaries, et cetera.</i>

10:23.490 --> 10:27.900
<i>Without even a single one of them, 
it might not have ended in victory.</i>

10:29.560 --> 10:32.810
I hear your eldest son threw 
himself in the line of fire

10:32.810 --> 10:36.860
to protect Marquis Aiblinger and Miss Mitsuha.

10:36.860 --> 10:37.690
Yes.

10:37.690 --> 10:42.590
And that brave, loyal soul 
is on the brink of death,

10:42.590 --> 10:45.020
in an infirmary provided by Miss Mitsuha.

10:45.020 --> 10:45.910
Yes...

10:46.530 --> 10:52.230
Then let us recognize that deed 
and see him off as a titled noble.

10:53.260 --> 10:56.110
He will be granted the title of baron.

10:56.750 --> 11:00.850
In due time, that title will 
pass over to the head family,

11:00.850 --> 11:03.740
to be carried on by one of your children 
or grandchildren who does not succeed you.

11:03.740 --> 11:05.100
Your Majesty...

11:05.100 --> 11:11.270
That way, word of his deeds can be 
passed down along with his title forevermore.

11:11.680 --> 11:14.110
Th-Thank you very much.

11:14.110 --> 11:16.930
<i>That must really come as a great honor.</i>

11:17.470 --> 11:18.480
I object!

11:18.480 --> 11:19.240
<i>What?!</i>

11:21.110 --> 11:24.740
<i>Marquis Aiblinger? 
The very one who was saved?</i>

11:24.740 --> 11:27.580
And for what reason, Marquis Aiblinger?

11:28.240 --> 11:30.580
The title of baron is not 
befitting of his deeds!

11:31.150 --> 11:37.090
If it's not viscount at the very least, 
I won't be able to look him in the face!

11:38.870 --> 11:40.600
Lord Aiblinger...

11:45.350 --> 11:48.390
I apologize. I was lacking in consideration.

11:48.390 --> 11:50.890
Is there anyone who objects 
to the title of viscount, then?

11:53.020 --> 11:54.860
<i>Of course there isn't.</i>

11:55.580 --> 11:58.900
Finally, the one who has served us 
most greatly, Miss Mitsuha.

11:58.900 --> 12:00.860
Is there anything that you desire?

12:00.860 --> 12:02.070
In that case...

12:02.070 --> 12:05.000
I'd ask you to award honors not to myself, 
but the ones who fought for justice

12:05.000 --> 12:09.250
to save this kingdom in its time of need, 
the soldiers from my homeland.

12:10.330 --> 12:13.700
I was told it was by the secret arts 
of the Messenger of Lightning

12:13.700 --> 12:15.460
that they were summoned here.

12:15.460 --> 12:16.760
Yes.

12:16.760 --> 12:20.410
I am forbidden to speak at greater length.

12:20.410 --> 12:23.630
Is that right? 
Then I will not pursue the matter.

12:24.180 --> 12:25.840
Thank you very much.

12:26.440 --> 12:30.960
For my sake, they rushed here, 
carrying Sacred Relics of battle,

12:30.960 --> 12:32.560
without national authorization.

12:32.950 --> 12:36.150
However, they broke the rules by involving 
themselves in the affairs of other nations,

12:36.150 --> 12:38.680
and all of them will be punished heavily

12:38.680 --> 12:40.930
for the crime of expending 
the Sacred Relics of battle.

12:40.930 --> 12:41.820
What?!

12:42.550 --> 12:46.320
It's caused trouble for their families, as well, 
and some may even be left homeless...

12:47.200 --> 12:48.380
Can that be true?

12:48.380 --> 12:49.550
Those brave heroes...

12:49.550 --> 12:51.410
<i>Okay! Now to finish it off!</i>

12:51.990 --> 12:56.350
What a cruel fate, for these 
soldiers to suffer so for justice!

12:56.800 --> 12:59.630
I want to repay them for their kindness!

13:00.890 --> 13:05.350
I humbly ask for a letter to serve 
as vindication of their actions fighting,

13:05.350 --> 13:07.760
as well as enough funds to set aside 
for damage to the Sacred Relics,

13:07.760 --> 13:11.600
along with reparations 
for those left without means!

13:13.570 --> 13:17.470
I believe that those will 
definitely be of use in restoring

13:17.470 --> 13:19.000
the honor of these heroes!

13:19.090 --> 13:19.900
Oh!

13:19.900 --> 13:21.640
That's true...

13:22.920 --> 13:26.120
<i>I promised Wolf's Fang 40,000 gold...</i>

13:26.120 --> 13:29.110
<i>Wait, not just that, there was 
additional pay, as well...</i>

13:29.110 --> 13:32.450
<i>What do I do if they only 
offer 3,000 gold or something?!</i>

13:32.450 --> 13:34.210
Three thousand gold!

13:35.530 --> 13:38.280
My house will provide 3,000 gold!

13:38.280 --> 13:39.670
Count Bozes...

13:39.670 --> 13:41.290
Five thousand gold from me!

13:41.670 --> 13:43.420
Marquis Aiblinger!

13:44.720 --> 13:46.230
Twenty-five hundred gold!

13:46.690 --> 13:47.800
Three thousand gold!

13:47.800 --> 13:49.530
Two thousand gold from me!

13:49.530 --> 13:53.120
<i>Wait, am I going to easily hit my target here?</i>

13:53.120 --> 13:54.610
We'll give 2,000 gold!

13:54.610 --> 13:55.850
Twelve hundred gold!

13:55.850 --> 13:57.600
I'll put up 1,500 gold!

13:57.600 --> 14:00.360
Everyone, I can't thank you enough...

14:00.360 --> 14:03.210
Chancellor Sahr, order the finance minister

14:03.210 --> 14:05.470
to draw as much possible 
gold from the treasury.

14:05.470 --> 14:06.740
As you wish.

14:07.160 --> 14:09.910
All of you contributed to 
a great cause on this day.

14:09.910 --> 14:12.580
There's one more thing 
I'd like to ask of you.

14:13.350 --> 14:14.790
State your wish.

14:15.350 --> 14:19.170
I ask of you to grant me 
citizenship in your kingdom!

14:21.250 --> 14:24.580
I abandoned my home country, 
and ended up in this kingdom,

14:24.580 --> 14:26.890
a rootless wanderer here only temporarily.

14:26.890 --> 14:30.350
But now, my wish is to become a citizen 
of this royal capital, this kingdom,

14:30.350 --> 14:33.830
and call it my new homeland.

14:34.470 --> 14:38.730
I had thought you were already 
a citizen of this kingdom.

14:38.730 --> 14:40.440
Yes, in my heart.

14:40.440 --> 14:45.440
But I possess no grounds by which I can 
call myself a subject of Your Majesty.

14:45.440 --> 14:46.610
Is that so?

14:46.610 --> 14:50.790
Then let me bestow upon you proof 
that you are a member of this kingdom,

14:50.790 --> 14:52.700
that not even you yourself can deny.

14:54.120 --> 14:56.550
You've fulfilled your duty 
to protect the kingdom!

14:56.550 --> 14:58.080
Now to gain rights!

14:58.080 --> 15:00.200
<i>If I officially gain citizenship rights,</i>

15:00.200 --> 15:02.750
<i>I become entitled to protection 
from the government.</i>

15:02.750 --> 15:05.390
<i>It'll make doing business easier!</i>

15:05.390 --> 15:08.720
<i>Maybe I'll come up with 
a new way to make money.</i>

15:09.640 --> 15:13.680
I bestow upon you the title of 
viscountess, Mitsuha von Yamano.

15:13.680 --> 15:15.890
What?!

15:15.890 --> 15:18.890
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

15:18.890 --> 15:21.890
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

15:22.320 --> 15:24.860
That's all the payment you owe, duly received.

15:25.710 --> 15:27.820
You sold the dragon fang?!

15:28.150 --> 15:31.300
It was a deal with a big-time 
teacher from Harvard.

15:31.300 --> 15:34.410
That professor, even with just 
cursory examination of that fang,

15:34.410 --> 15:40.410
said he sees infinite possibilities 
for new R&D based on dragon materials.

15:40.410 --> 15:42.580
That might not end well...

15:42.580 --> 15:46.010
What if they make a big fuss 
asking where you found it?

15:46.010 --> 15:49.380
I didn't tell him I brought it 
back from that world, of course.

15:49.380 --> 15:52.080
Well, yeah, if you started 
talking about other worlds,

15:52.080 --> 15:54.760
things would end up getting 
complicated pretty quickly...

15:54.760 --> 15:58.930
I warned him to stick to the story that he 
accidentally created it in his lab by chance.

15:58.930 --> 16:01.700
I've secured all the patent-related rights,

16:01.700 --> 16:03.940
so now I'm guaranteed to make a fortune!

16:05.310 --> 16:09.690
Sounds like a good chance to call it quits 
on dangerous mercenary work.

16:09.690 --> 16:11.120
Nope, we'll stay in the business.

16:11.120 --> 16:11.900
Eh?

16:11.900 --> 16:15.200
That's the only thing we're good at.

16:15.200 --> 16:20.000
Nothing good will come out of having 
all that money and free time.

16:21.040 --> 16:24.500
Does that mean I can count on your 
services if they're ever needed again?

16:25.540 --> 16:26.980
Leave it to us.

16:29.960 --> 16:31.510
Closed for Today

16:31.380 --> 16:33.470
<b>Maiden Couture</b>

16:34.820 --> 16:35.680
Here I go!

16:35.680 --> 16:38.440
Mitsuha, Cosplay Power Make-Up!

16:39.940 --> 16:43.390
We will now begin 
the title conferral ceremony!

16:55.100 --> 16:56.840
Mitsuha von Yamano.

16:56.840 --> 16:59.540
I confer upon you the title of viscountess!

17:09.280 --> 17:10.950
Viscountess Yamano.

17:10.950 --> 17:11.670
Yes.

17:11.670 --> 17:15.530
Will you accept on his 
behalf the title conferred

17:15.530 --> 17:19.760
upon Count Bozes's eldest son, 
Alexis, who could not be here?

17:20.300 --> 17:21.470
Eh?

17:24.520 --> 17:26.140
I refuse.

17:28.500 --> 17:29.810
Unforgivable!

17:29.810 --> 17:31.230
Arrest her!

17:31.230 --> 17:33.610
What insolence!

17:40.720 --> 17:42.720
I thought he was in critical condition!

17:44.040 --> 17:47.680
You should be directly 
conferring that title on him!

17:51.000 --> 17:53.390
Alexis von Bozes.

17:53.390 --> 17:55.220
I confer upon you the title of viscount!

17:55.850 --> 17:57.930
I humbly accept.

17:59.370 --> 18:04.640
The honorable title of viscount, received 
directly from Your Majesty for my deeds...

18:04.640 --> 18:08.190
I intend to work hard and live up to this title 
as the head of a glorious new noble house!

18:13.360 --> 18:16.160
Theodore will be succeeding 
my father's title of count.

18:16.830 --> 18:19.910
Your younger brother will be 
a higher rank than you, then.

18:19.910 --> 18:22.030
That's no problem.

18:22.030 --> 18:26.330
By the time my father retires, 
I'll have risen to become a count, as well.

18:26.330 --> 18:28.540
Please look forward to it, my lady.

18:30.900 --> 18:35.900
<i>In any case, Yamano Mitsuha has 
become a noble in another world!</i>

18:37.470 --> 18:39.390
I wonder if the war has ended.

18:39.390 --> 18:40.920
That's what I hear.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.720
Nothing beats peace and quiet.

18:42.720 --> 18:44.190
You can say that again.

18:44.190 --> 18:46.660
I wonder how Mitsuha is doing...

18:50.350 --> 18:51.580
Colette!

18:52.640 --> 18:54.650
Colette, I came to see you!

18:54.650 --> 18:56.780
Mitsuha! It's Mitsuha!

18:56.780 --> 18:58.680
Ow, ow, ow...

18:58.680 --> 19:01.320
Please don't! I told you not to do that!

19:01.760 --> 19:04.790
Wow! You chased away a dragon?!

19:05.260 --> 19:07.620
Then, all the monsters ran away, too!

19:07.620 --> 19:10.540
One thing led to another, 
and the Empire's army stopped fighting!

19:10.870 --> 19:13.770
You really did a lot, Mitsuha!

19:13.770 --> 19:15.500
That's right. And so...

19:16.010 --> 19:21.180
The king recognized my achievements, 
and I became a viscountess...

19:21.180 --> 19:23.200
I'm a noble in this kingdom now.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.140
Eh?

19:24.910 --> 19:29.110
The land I'm in charge of is a little 
over half a day of walking from here.

19:29.110 --> 19:30.350
Pretty close by, huh?

19:30.350 --> 19:31.760
That's, well...

19:31.760 --> 19:34.320
Congratulations, Lady Mitsuha...

19:34.320 --> 19:35.890
Huh? Why so formal?

19:35.890 --> 19:39.060
I mean, you're a viscountess now, right?

19:39.060 --> 19:39.810
So...

19:39.810 --> 19:41.000
Colette!

19:43.340 --> 19:48.760
I may be a viscountess, but I'm the same 
Mitsuha that you saved back then.

19:48.760 --> 19:52.290
So you don't have to change either, Colette.

19:52.290 --> 19:54.780
Mitsuha, thank you!

19:55.390 --> 19:59.100
Hey! Wait! I'm not done talking...

19:59.610 --> 20:00.650
Talking?

20:04.120 --> 20:07.430
Colette, won't you come work in my territory?

20:07.430 --> 20:08.660
Huh?

20:08.660 --> 20:12.640
And as my potential future retainer, 
I want you to learn about all sorts of things.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.160
Well?

20:15.400 --> 20:16.720
But...

20:16.720 --> 20:18.550
That sounds great!

20:18.550 --> 20:19.350
Yes!

20:19.350 --> 20:20.360
Really?!

20:20.360 --> 20:24.590
A country village girl like you 
working for a noble house!

20:24.590 --> 20:27.220
That's a success story if I've ever heard one!

20:27.220 --> 20:28.740
Please take good care of her.

20:29.280 --> 20:30.130
Yes!

20:30.130 --> 20:32.810
I'll take full responsibility 
in looking after her.

20:33.480 --> 20:36.230
You can rest assured 
that she's in good hands!

20:38.420 --> 20:39.800
Feudal Lords
Feudal lordship was a largely hereditary system of government and local autonomy found in the feudal era. A number of feudal lords were incorporated into the state as nobility.

21:27.690 --> 21:29.740
<i>So this is my territory.</i>

21:29.740 --> 21:32.680
<i>There are people who call this place home.</i>

21:32.680 --> 21:35.510
<i>I need to do a good job 
managing and developing it!</i>

21:36.220 --> 21:37.770
<i>That being said...</i>

21:42.250 --> 21:48.490
<i>My fight to save 80,000 gold in another world 
for my retirement has only just begun!</i>

21:48.490 --> 21:50.990
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold
in Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

21:50.990 --> 21:53.870
<b>Fin</b>

22:05.840 --> 22:08.530
<i>I open my eyes, and where do I find myself?</i>

22:10.470 --> 22:13.180
<i>Maybe I should go back to bed</i>

22:15.060 --> 22:17.650
<i>Pretending I'm still half-asleep</i>

22:19.190 --> 22:23.710
<i>Running away from reality, 
to the west and east</i>

22:24.360 --> 22:26.120
<i>To be honest, life's all about</i>

22:26.120 --> 22:28.880
<i>Taking falls and getting back up 
(heavy damage)</i>

22:28.880 --> 22:31.990
<i>Hurt as it may, there's 
still a long road ahead...</i>

22:33.660 --> 22:36.450
<i>Looks like I've reached the end of my rope</i>

22:38.470 --> 22:40.960
<i>Hitting life's harder levels</i>

22:42.750 --> 22:47.320
<i>That's a test from the gods 
that I'll take on</i>

22:47.320 --> 22:49.780
<i>First things first, gotta be the economy!</i>

22:49.780 --> 22:52.430
<i>Aiming for the bourgeois life</i>

22:52.430 --> 22:54.180
<i>Gotta be the economy!</i>

22:54.180 --> 22:57.080
<i>No matter what enemies may come my way</i>

22:57.080 --> 22:59.140
<i>Gotta be the economy!</i>

22:59.140 --> 23:01.680
<i>I'll get them on my side</i>

23:01.680 --> 23:03.740
<i>Gotta be the economy!</i>

23:03.740 --> 23:06.280
<i>Who doesn't need money, after all?</i>

23:06.280 --> 23:10.990
<i>To the days where you need to 
scrape by one way or another</i>

23:10.990 --> 23:18.460
<i>Here's to you!</i>
